      ******************************************************************
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. B372M011.
      ******************************************************************
      **INV: A372VENM
      ******************************************************************
      * APLICACIÓN.....: VENCIMIENTOS MANUALES                         *
      * ANALISTA.......: INDRA                                         *
      * PROGRAMADOR....: INDRA                                         *
      * FECHA DE REALIZACIÓN: MAYO 2026                                *
      *                                                                *
      * DESCRIPCIÓN:                                                   *
      *   ------------------------------------------------------------ *
      *  | CONSULTA DE DATOS ADICIONALES DE MIGRACION DE LA TABLA DE  |*
      *  | EXPEDIENTES DE VENCIMIENTOS MANUALES                       |*
      *   ------------------------------------------------------------ *
      *                                                                *
      *  PARAMETROS:                                                   *
      *  OPERACION LISTA:                                              *
      *        SELECCION...'01': CONSULTA DE LOS DATOS A PARTIR DEL    *
      *                          AÑO Y EXPEDIENTE DE ENTRADA           *
      *                                                                *
      *  OPERACION DETALLE:                                            *
      *        SELECCION...'01': CONSULTA DE LOS DATOS POR EL AÑO Y    *
      *                          EXPEDIENTE                            *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * TABLA DE TRABAJO
      ******************************************************************
      *
      * TB372MIG0    TABLA DE DATOS AUXILIARES VENCIMIENTOS MANUALES
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * CODIGO DE ERRORES
      ******************************************************************
      *
      * X372M011-CRETORNO-S
      *         '00' OPERACION CORRECTA
      *
      *         '01' ERROR EN MODO
      *
      *         '02' ERROR FALTAN DATOS INFORMADOS
      *
      *         '03' ERROR REGISTRO NO ENCONTRADO
      *
      *         '04' OPERACION NO VALIDA
      *
      *         '99' ERROR EN ACCESO A BASE DE DATOS
      *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 FILLER.
          03 FILLER PIC X(40) VALUE 'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SECTION'.

      *****************************************************
      ** SWITCH **
      *****************************************************
          03 SW-SWITCH.
             05 SW-ERROR-DB2   PIC S9(3)  VALUE  0.
                88 DB2-OK                 VALUE  0.
                88 DB2-NOTFND             VALUE +100.
                88 DB2-DUPLICADO          VALUE -803.
                88 DB2-SELECTDUP          VALUE -811.

             05 SW-COPERACION       PIC X.
                88 LISTA                  VALUE "L".
                88 DETALLE                VALUE "D".

             05 SW-BD               PIC X.
                88 BD-ABIERTA             VALUE "A".
                88 BD-CERRADA             VALUE "C".

             05 SW-PRIMERA-LECTURA        PIC X  VALUE '0'.
                88 NO-PRIMERA-LECTURA            VALUE '1'.
                88 PRIMERA-LECTURA               VALUE '0'.

      *****************************************************
      *   CONTROL PARA SABER SI EL CURSOR SE HA ABIERTO   *
      *****************************************************

             05 SW-CURSOR-ABIERTO         PIC X  VALUE '0'.
                88 NO-CURSOR-OK                  VALUE '1'.
                88 CURSOR-OK                     VALUE '0'.
      ****************************************************
      *   CONTROL DE ERRORES DEL PROGRAMA
      ****************************************************
             05 SW-ERROR                  PIC X.
                88 SI-ERROR                      VALUE "S".
                88 NO-ERROR                      VALUE "N".


      *    CAMPOS BUSQUEDA/SIGUIENTES

           03 WS-BUSQUEDA.
              05 B-ANIO           PIC S9(4)V USAGE COMP-3.
              05 B-KEXPEDIENTE    PIC S9(10)V USAGE COMP-3.

      ****************************************************
      *VARIABLES AUXILIARES
      ****************************************************
          03 WS-VARIABLES-PAG.
             05 WS-ANT-ANO                PIC S9(4)V USAGE COMP-3.
             05 WS-ANT-KEXPEDIENTE        PIC S9(10)V USAGE COMP-3.

      ****************************************************
      ** LITERALES
      ****************************************************
          03 LT-LITERALES.
             05 LT-NREGENT                PIC 9(03) VALUE 50.

      *    INDICES

           03 X                   PIC 9(03)        VALUE ZEROES.

      ****************************************************
      ** AREA DE COMUNICACION CON DB2
      ****************************************************
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA     END-EXEC.
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE T372MIG0  END-EXEC.

      ******************************************************************
      * CURSOR PARA RECUPERAR LOS DATOS AUXILIARES DE LOS EXPEDIENTES
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL DECLARE C1 CURSOR FOR
           SELECT MIG0_ANIO            ,
                  MIG0_KEXPEDIENTE     ,
                  MIG0_VEN_MIGR        ,
                  MIG0_USUARIO_PAGO    ,
                  MIG0_FCAPTURA        ,
                  MIG0_CUSUARIO_CAPT   ,
                  MIG0_FORMAPAGO       ,
                  MIG0_NUM_CHEQUE      ,
                  MIG0_NUM_CUENTA      ,
                  MIG0_REF_REINVERSION ,
                  MIG0_CUSU_PAGO_COMP1 ,
                  MIG0_FCAPTURA_COMP1  ,
                  MIG0_CUSU_CAPT_COMP1 ,
                  MIG0_FORMAPAGO_COMP1 ,
                  MIG0_NCHEQUE_COMP1   ,
                  MIG0_NCUENTA_COMP1   ,
                  MIG0_CUSU_PAGO_COMP2 ,
                  MIG0_FCAPTURA_COMP2  ,
                  MIG0_CUSU_CAPT_COMP2 ,
                  MIG0_FORMAPAGO_COMP2 ,
                  MIG0_NCHEQUE_COMP2   ,
                  MIG0_NCUENTA_COMP2   ,
                  MIG0_GRADO_DISCAP    ,
                  MIG0_PREST_VIVIENDA  ,
                  MIG0_SITU_FAMILIAR   ,
                  MIG0_NIF_CONYUGUE    ,
                  MIG0_ICOMPENSATORIA  ,
                  MIG0_IMPALIMENHIJOS
                FROM TB372MIG0
                WHERE   MIG0_ANIO          >= :MIG0-ANIO
                  AND   MIG0_KEXPEDIENTE   >= :MIG0-KEXPEDIENTE
      * VARIABLES DE PAGINACION
                  AND ((MIG0_ANIO          >  :B-ANIO
                   OR  (MIG0_ANIO          =  :B-ANIO
                  AND  (MIG0_KEXPEDIENTE   >  :B-KEXPEDIENTE
                   OR   MIG0_KEXPEDIENTE   =  :B-KEXPEDIENTE))))
             ORDER BY MIG0_ANIO,
                      MIG0_KEXPEDIENTE
           END-EXEC.

          03 FILLER PIC X(40) VALUE 'FINAL WORKING-STORAGE SECTION'.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 DFHCOMMAREA.
             COPY X372M011.

      *************************************************************
      * PROCEDURE DIVISION.                                       *
      *************************************************************
      *
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DFHCOMMAREA.

           PERFORM INICIO.

           IF NO-ERROR
              PERFORM PROCESO
           END-IF

           PERFORM TERMINAR.

       INICIO.
      *-------
           PERFORM INICIALIZAR-VARIABLES.
           PERFORM VALIDAR-ENTRADA
           IF NO-ERROR
              PERFORM DATOS-SIGUIENTE
           END-IF
           .

       PROCESO.
      *--------
      *D*
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - PROCESO'
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - X372M011-COPERACION: '
                                X372M011-COPERACION
      *f*
           EVALUATE X372M011-COPERACION
              WHEN "L"
                 SET LISTA TO TRUE
              WHEN "D"
                 SET DETALLE TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
      *-->       Operación no válida
                 SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE
                 MOVE "OPERACION NO VALIDA" TO X372M011-GERROR
                 MOVE "04"                  TO X372M011-CRETORNO
           END-EVALUATE.

           IF NO-ERROR
              PERFORM COMPONER-NUMERO-REGISTROS
              IF LISTA
                 PERFORM TRATAR-LISTADO
              ELSE
                 PERFORM TRATAR-DETALLE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       TERMINAR.
      *---------
           GOBACK.

       INICIALIZAR-VARIABLES.
      *----------------------
           SET NO-ERROR   TO TRUE.
           SET DB2-OK     TO TRUE.
           SET BD-CERRADA TO TRUE.
           MOVE "00"   TO X372M011-CRETORNO

           MOVE ZEROES TO X372M011-CERRORSQL
                          X372M011-NREGSAL.

       VALIDAR-ENTRADA.
      *----------------
      *D*
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - VALIDAR-ENTRADA'
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - X372M011-ANIO-B: ' X372M011-ANIO-B
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - X372M011-KEXPEDIENTE-B: '
                                X372M011-KEXPEDIENTE-B
      *F*
           EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN X372M011-ANIO-B        IS NOT NUMERIC
            WHEN X372M011-KEXPEDIENTE-B IS NOT NUMERIC
      *-->     ERROR VALOR EN VARIABLE NUMERICA
               SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE "ANIO O EXPEDIENTE NO NUMERICO"
                            TO X372M011-GERROR
               MOVE "10"    TO X372M011-CRETORNO
            WHEN OTHER
              CONTINUE
           END-EVALUATE
           .

       DATOS-SIGUIENTE.
      *----------------
      *    COMPROBAR DATOS SIGUIENTE / MOVER DATOS CLAVE.

           INITIALIZE WS-BUSQUEDA.
           IF X372M011-SSIGUIENTE = "S"
              MOVE X372M011-ANIO-S          TO B-ANIO
              MOVE X372M011-KEXPEDIENTE-S   TO B-KEXPEDIENTE
           ELSE
              MOVE X372M011-ANIO-B          TO B-ANIO
              MOVE X372M011-KEXPEDIENTE-B   TO B-KEXPEDIENTE
           END-IF.
           INITIALIZE X372M011-MIG0-S.
           MOVE "N" TO X372M011-SSIGUIENTE.

           MOVE X372M011-ANIO-B          TO MIG0-ANIO.
           MOVE X372M011-KEXPEDIENTE-B   TO MIG0-KEXPEDIENTE.

       COMPONER-NUMERO-REGISTROS.
      *--------------------------
           IF X372M011-NREGENT IS NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE ZEROES TO X372M011-NREGENT
           END-IF.

           IF LISTA
              IF X372M011-NREGENT = ZEROES OR
                 X372M011-NREGENT > LT-NREGENT
                 MOVE LT-NREGENT TO X372M011-NREGENT
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE 1 TO X372M011-NREGENT
           END-IF.

       TRATAR-LISTADO.
      *---------------
           PERFORM ABRIR-LEER-CURSOR.

           PERFORM CARGAR-DATOS-LISTADO VARYING X FROM 1 BY 1
              UNTIL X > X372M011-NREGENT OR DB2-NOTFND OR SI-ERROR.

           IF NO-ERROR AND DB2-OK AND X > X372M011-NREGENT
              MOVE "S"              TO X372M011-SSIGUIENTE
              MOVE MIG0-ANIO        TO X372M011-ANIO-S
              MOVE MIG0-KEXPEDIENTE TO X372M011-KEXPEDIENTE-S
           END-IF.

           IF BD-ABIERTA
              PERFORM CERRAR-CURSOR
           END-IF.

       TRATAR-DETALLE.
      *---------------
           PERFORM LEER-REGISTRO.
           IF NO-ERROR AND DB2-OK
              MOVE 1 TO X
              PERFORM CARGAR-DATOS
           END-IF.

       CARGAR-DATOS-LISTADO.
      *---------------------
           PERFORM CARGAR-DATOS
           PERFORM LEER-CURSOR.

       CARGAR-DATOS.
      *-------------
           ADD 1 TO X372M011-NREGSAL.
           MOVE MIG0-ANIO              TO X372M011-ANIO-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-KEXPEDIENTE       TO X372M011-KEXPEDIENTE-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-VEN-MIGR          TO X372M011-VEN-MIGR-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-USUARIO-PAGO      TO X372M011-USUARIO-PAGO-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-FCAPTURA          TO X372M011-FCAPTURA-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-CUSUARIO-CAPT     TO X372M011-CUSUARIO-CAPT-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-FORMAPAGO         TO X372M011-FORMAPAGO-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-NUM-CHEQUE        TO X372M011-NUM-CHEQUE-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-NUM-CUENTA        TO X372M011-NUM-CUENTA-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-REF-REINVERSION   TO X372M011-REF-REINVERSION-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-CUSU-PAGO-COMP1   TO X372M011-CUSU-PAGO-COMP1-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-FCAPTURA-COMP1    TO X372M011-FCAPTURA-COMP1-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-CUSU-CAPT-COMP1   TO X372M011-CUSU-CAPT-COMP1-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-FORMAPAGO-COMP1   TO X372M011-FORMAPAGO-COMP1-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-NCHEQUE-COMP1     TO X372M011-NCHEQUE-COMP1-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-NCUENTA-COMP1     TO X372M011-NCUENTA-COMP1-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-CUSU-PAGO-COMP2   TO X372M011-CUSU-PAGO-COMP2-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-FCAPTURA-COMP2    TO X372M011-FCAPTURA-COMP2-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-CUSU-CAPT-COMP2   TO X372M011-CUSU-CAPT-COMP2-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-FORMAPAGO-COMP2   TO X372M011-FORMAPAGO-COMP2-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-NCHEQUE-COMP2     TO X372M011-NCHEQUE-COMP2-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-NCUENTA-COMP2     TO X372M011-NCUENTA-COMP2-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-GRADO-DISCAP      TO X372M011-GRADO-DISCAP-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-PREST-VIVIENDA    TO X372M011-PREST-VIVIENDA-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-SITU-FAMILIAR     TO X372M011-SITU-FAMILIAR-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-NIF-CONYUGUE      TO X372M011-NIF-CONYUGUE-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-ICOMPENSATORIA    TO X372M011-ICOMPENSATORIA-T(X).
           MOVE MIG0-IMPALIMENHIJOS    TO X372M011-IMPALIMENHIJOS-T(X).

      *
       ABRIR-LEER-CURSOR.
      *------------------
      *D*
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - ABRIR-LEER-CURSOR'
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - X372M011-CSELECCION: '
                                X372M011-CSELECCION
      *F*
           EVALUATE X372M011-CSELECCION

              WHEN "01"
                 EXEC SQL
                    OPEN C1
                 END-EXEC

              WHEN OTHER
      *-->       Selección de búsqueda incorrecto
                 SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE
                 MOVE "SELECCIóN DE BúSQUEDA INCORRECTO"
                           TO X372M011-GERROR
                 MOVE "06" TO X372M011-CRETORNO

           END-EVALUATE.

      *D*
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - SQLCODE: ' SQLCODE
      *F*
           IF NO-ERROR
              MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2
              IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
      *-->       Error al abrir el cursor
                 SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE
                 MOVE "01"            TO X372M011-CRETORNO
                 MOVE "ERROR AL ABRIR EL CURSOR"
                                      TO X372M011-GERROR
                 MOVE SW-ERROR-DB2 TO X372M011-CERRORSQL
              ELSE
                 SET BD-ABIERTA TO TRUE
                 PERFORM LEER-CURSOR
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       LEER-CURSOR.
      *------------
           EVALUATE X372M011-CSELECCION

              WHEN "01"
                 EXEC SQL
                    FETCH C1
                    INTO
                         :MIG0-ANIO,
                         :MIG0-KEXPEDIENTE,
                         :MIG0-VEN-MIGR,
                         :MIG0-USUARIO-PAGO,
                         :MIG0-FCAPTURA,
                         :MIG0-CUSUARIO-CAPT,
                         :MIG0-FORMAPAGO,
                         :MIG0-NUM-CHEQUE,
                         :MIG0-NUM-CUENTA,
                         :MIG0-REF-REINVERSION,
                         :MIG0-CUSU-PAGO-COMP1,
                         :MIG0-FCAPTURA-COMP1,
                         :MIG0-CUSU-CAPT-COMP1,
                         :MIG0-FORMAPAGO-COMP1,
                         :MIG0-NCHEQUE-COMP1,
                         :MIG0-NCUENTA-COMP1,
                         :MIG0-CUSU-PAGO-COMP2,
                         :MIG0-FCAPTURA-COMP2,
                         :MIG0-CUSU-CAPT-COMP2,
                         :MIG0-FORMAPAGO-COMP2,
                         :MIG0-NCHEQUE-COMP2,
                         :MIG0-NCUENTA-COMP2,
                         :MIG0-GRADO-DISCAP,
                         :MIG0-PREST-VIVIENDA,
                         :MIG0-SITU-FAMILIAR,
                         :MIG0-NIF-CONYUGUE,
                         :MIG0-ICOMPENSATORIA,
                         :MIG0-IMPALIMENHIJOS
                 END-EXEC

           END-EVALUATE.

      *D*
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - LEER-CURSOR'
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - SQLCODE: ' SQLCODE
      *F*
           MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
      *-->    Error al leer el cursor
              SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE
              MOVE "02"          TO X372M011-CRETORNO
              MOVE "ERROR AL LEER EL CURSOR"
                                 TO X372M011-GERROR
              MOVE SW-ERROR-DB2  TO X372M011-CERRORSQL
           END-IF.

       LEER-REGISTRO.
      *--------------
           EVALUATE X372M011-CSELECCION

              WHEN "01"
                 EXEC SQL
                    SELECT
                           MIG0_ANIO,
                           MIG0_KEXPEDIENTE,
                           MIG0_VEN_MIGR,
                           MIG0_USUARIO_PAGO,
                           MIG0_FCAPTURA,
                           MIG0_CUSUARIO_CAPT,
                           MIG0_FORMAPAGO,
                           MIG0_NUM_CHEQUE,
                           MIG0_NUM_CUENTA,
                           MIG0_REF_REINVERSION,
                           MIG0_CUSU_PAGO_COMP1,
                           MIG0_FCAPTURA_COMP1,
                           MIG0_CUSU_CAPT_COMP1,
                           MIG0_FORMAPAGO_COMP1,
                           MIG0_NCHEQUE_COMP1,
                           MIG0_NCUENTA_COMP1,
                           MIG0_CUSU_PAGO_COMP2,
                           MIG0_FCAPTURA_COMP2,
                           MIG0_CUSU_CAPT_COMP2,
                           MIG0_FORMAPAGO_COMP2,
                           MIG0_NCHEQUE_COMP2,
                           MIG0_NCUENTA_COMP2,
                           MIG0_GRADO_DISCAP,
                           MIG0_PREST_VIVIENDA,
                           MIG0_SITU_FAMILIAR,
                           MIG0_NIF_CONYUGUE,
                           MIG0_ICOMPENSATORIA,
                           MIG0_IMPALIMENHIJOS
                    INTO
                           :MIG0-ANIO,
                           :MIG0-KEXPEDIENTE,
                           :MIG0-VEN-MIGR,
                           :MIG0-USUARIO-PAGO,
                           :MIG0-FCAPTURA,
                           :MIG0-CUSUARIO-CAPT,
                           :MIG0-FORMAPAGO,
                           :MIG0-NUM-CHEQUE,
                           :MIG0-NUM-CUENTA,
                           :MIG0-REF-REINVERSION,
                           :MIG0-CUSU-PAGO-COMP1,
                           :MIG0-FCAPTURA-COMP1,
                           :MIG0-CUSU-CAPT-COMP1,
                           :MIG0-FORMAPAGO-COMP1,
                           :MIG0-NCHEQUE-COMP1,
                           :MIG0-NCUENTA-COMP1,
                           :MIG0-CUSU-PAGO-COMP2,
                           :MIG0-FCAPTURA-COMP2,
                           :MIG0-CUSU-CAPT-COMP2,
                           :MIG0-FORMAPAGO-COMP2,
                           :MIG0-NCHEQUE-COMP2,
                           :MIG0-NCUENTA-COMP2,
                           :MIG0-GRADO-DISCAP,
                           :MIG0-PREST-VIVIENDA,
                           :MIG0-SITU-FAMILIAR,
                           :MIG0-NIF-CONYUGUE,
                           :MIG0-ICOMPENSATORIA,
                           :MIG0-IMPALIMENHIJOS
                    FROM
                           TB372MIG0
                    WHERE
                           MIG0_ANIO        = :B-ANIO         AND
                           MIG0_KEXPEDIENTE = :B-KEXPEDIENTE
                 END-EXEC

              WHEN OTHER
      *-->       Selección de búsqueda incorrecto
                 MOVE "06" TO X372M011-CRETORNO
                 MOVE "SELECCIóN DE BúSQUEDA INCORRECTO"
                           TO X372M011-GERROR
                 SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE

           END-EVALUATE.

      *D*
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - LEER-REGISTRO'
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - SQLCODE: ' SQLCODE
      *F*
           IF NO-ERROR
              MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2
              IF NOT DB2-OK
                 IF DB2-NOTFND
      *-->          NO SE HA ENCONTRADO EL EXPEDIENTE
                    SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE
                    MOVE "05"          TO X372M011-CRETORNO
                    MOVE "NO SE HA ENCONTRADO EL EXPEDIENTE"
                                       TO X372M011-GERROR
                    MOVE SW-ERROR-DB2  TO X372M011-CERRORSQL
                 ELSE
      *-->          ERROR EJECUCIóN SQL
                    SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE
                    MOVE "07"          TO X372M011-CRETORNO
                    MOVE "ERROR EN LA CONSULTA DEL EXPEDIENTE"
                                       TO X372M011-GERROR
                    MOVE SW-ERROR-DB2  TO X372M011-CERRORSQL
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       CERRAR-CURSOR.
      *--------------
           EVALUATE X372M011-CSELECCION

              WHEN "01"
                 EXEC SQL
                    CLOSE C1
                 END-EXEC

           END-EVALUATE.

      *D*
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - LCERRAR-CURSOR'
           DISPLAY ' B372M011 - SQLCODE: ' SQLCODE
      *F*
           MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2.

           IF (NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND)
      *-->     Error al cerrar el cursor
               SET SI-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE "03"         TO X372M011-CRETORNO
               MOVE "ERROR AL CERRAR EL CURSOR"
                                 TO X372M011-GERROR
               MOVE SW-ERROR-DB2 TO X372M011-CERRORSQL
           END-IF.

